As soon as the sources begin to appear on c.s.g., we will
put up the Official NetHack Binaries for the PC, 
version 3.1 patchlevel 2.

The file, nh312pc.exe, a self extracting zip archive, will
be placed on wuarchive.wustl.edu:pub/msdos_uploads/games.

In addition, nh312386.exe, also a self extracting zip archive,
will be placed there.  This file contains a second binary 
compiled with djgpp for 386 and greater machines.

Both packages we be individually complete, you need only to
download one.  Both binaries will run under Microsoft Windows.

If you are the maintainer of a ftp site and you wish to obtain
the packages directly from us, send me a note to  
kevins@ori.org or nethack-bugs.linc.cis.upenn.edu. 

The binaries will not be available on linc.cis.upenn.edu for
at least a week after the release on c.s.g.

